  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wild zones are great, aren’t they? I get to spend\nmy days catching Magikarp.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Have a look! I was able to catch an extra-large\nMagikarp! It said XL in its summary, so I know<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfor sure it’s a big one.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s extra large and extra splashy!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490074201900730020006500780074007200610020006C006100720067006500200061006E0064002000650078007400720061002000730070006C00610073006800790021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y’know, I daresay there isn’t a single Magikarp\nout there that’s bigger than mine!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Why, if you DO manage to catch a Magikarp that’s\nbigger than XL, I’d love to see it.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "S’pose I have heard there’s an unusually large\nMagikarp in Wild Zone 2.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut that’s just a rumor, mind you.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 114
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I dare you to show me a Magikarp that’s bigger\nthan mine!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006400610072006500200079006F007500200074006F002000730068006F00770020006D0065002000610020004D006100670069006B00610072007000200074006800610074201900730020006200690067006700650072000A007400680061006E0020006D0069006E00650021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s no way any Magikarp out there is bigger\nthan mine.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500720065201900730020006E006F002000770061007900200061006E00790020004D006100670069006B0061007200700020006F007500740020007400680065007200650020006900730020006200690067006700650072000A007400680061006E0020006D0069006E0065002E001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It seems so tiny compared to my Magikarp!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900740020007300650065006D007300200073006F002000740069006E007900200063006F006D0070006100720065006400200074006F0020006D00790020004D006100670069006B0061007200700021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I knew you couldn’t find a bigger Magikarp!\nHahaha!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006B006E0065007700200079006F007500200063006F0075006C0064006E20190074002000660069006E00640020006100200062006900670067006500720020004D006100670069006B0061007200700021000A0048006100680061006800610021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What’s this? That Magikarp of yours...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068006100742019007300200074006800690073003F002000540068006100740020004D006100670069006B0061007200700020006F006600200079006F007500720073002E002E002E001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whew! You had me worried for a moment, but my\nMagikarp is sliiightly bigger!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "H-how in the world did it get so HUGE?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048002D0068006F007700200069006E002000740068006500200077006F0072006C00640020006400690064002000690074002000670065007400200073006F00200048005500470045003F0021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s...it’s an alpha?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007420190073002E002E002E006900742019007300200061006E00200061006C007000680061003F001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What do you mean it’s an alpha?! That’s cheating!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007400200064006F00200079006F00750020006D00650061006E0020006900742019007300200061006E00200061006C007000680061003F002100200054006800610074201900730020006300680065006100740069006E00670021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Besides, I’m not accepting defeat just yet!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006500730069006400650073002C002000492019006D0020006E006F007400200061006300630065007000740069006E006700200064006500660065006100740020006A00750073007400200079006500740021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Everyone knows the true sign of a superior\nMagikarp is how high it can jump!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLet’s have a jump-off!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On your mark, get set, GO! Do your thing, my XL\nMagikarp!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E00200079006F007500720020006D00610072006B002C00200067006500740020007300650074002C00200047004F002100200044006F00200079006F007500720020007400680069006E0067002C0020006D007900200058004C000A004D006100670069006B0061007200700021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Such...such mighty jumping power...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007500630068002E002E002E00730075006300680020006D006900670068007400790020006A0075006D00700069006E006700200070006F007700650072002E002E002E001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I admit defeat. There’s no way I can compete with\nthat.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000610064006D006900740020006400650066006500610074002E002000540068006500720065201900730020006E006F002000770061007900200049002000630061006E00200063006F006D007000650074006500200077006900740068000A0074006800610074002E001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "An alpha Magikarp isn’t just big... It can jump\nhigher than anything I’ve ever seen.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "At least this experience gave me a new goal—I’m\ngoing to catch my own alpha Magikarp!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll have a whole army of massive Magikarp!\nOnward to Wild Zone 2!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C0020006800610076006500200061002000770068006F006C0065002000610072006D00790020006F00660020006D0061007300730069007600650020004D006100670069006B0061007200700021000A004F006E007700610072006400200074006F002000570069006C00640020005A006F006E0065002000320021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t think you’ll be the only one with an alpha\nMagikarp for long!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006E201900740020007400680069006E006B00200079006F00752019006C006C00200062006500200074006800650020006F006E006C00790020006F006E00650020007700690074006800200061006E00200061006C007000680061000A004D006100670069006B00610072007000200066006F00720020006C006F006E00670021001000020114013D0000",
